{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o050","title":"孙策略地江东，华歆幅巾奉迎，策待以上宾之礼","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-f472cdc97083c68a453c","label":"正文","text":"孙策略地江东，华歆幅巾奉迎，策待以上宾之礼","evidence":["zhonghua-q-77ce48827f9d3d1f5020"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-47343ca2b2c5cb86eba7","label":"裴注·胡冲吴历","text":"孙策击豫章，先遣虞翻说华歆；歆答久在江表常欲北归、孙会稽来吾便去；翻还报，策乃进军","evidence":["zhonghua-q-b8f4e3387f54f52da934"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-338c08020d9552a43ea7","label":"裴注·胡冲吴历","text":"华歆葛巾迎孙策，策谓歆府君年德名望远近所归、宜修子弟之礼，便向歆拜","evidence":["zhonghua-q-6dc55a9ca6ee03cb5121"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-68ae0d3a569950375d14","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"孙策略有扬州盛兵徇豫章，一郡大恐；官属请出郊迎，歆教曰无然；策至，一府请出避之，歆笑曰今将自来何遽避之；策与歆共坐谈议良久夜乃别去，义士闻之心服；策遂亲执子弟之礼，礼为上宾","evidence":["zhonghua-q-197a8859eb4316966bd1"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-7c194bff64a02918fcda","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"四方贤士大夫避地江南者甚众皆出华歆之下，每策大会坐上莫敢先发言；歆时起更衣则论议喧哗；歆能剧饮至石余不乱；江南号之曰华独坐","evidence":["zhonghua-q-e22152a0db3e83134242"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-c14e8b5e751e5cbf48e9","label":"裴注·虞溥江表传","text":"孙策在椒丘遣虞翻说华歆；歆请功曹刘壹入议，壹劝住城遣檄迎军；歆以为从计恐死有余责；壹以王景兴会稽盛强犹见原恕为解；夜逆作檄，明旦出城遣吏赍迎；策便进军与歆相见，待以上宾、接以朋友之礼","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"略地江东而礼待华歆者；进军者；向歆拜者；徇豫章执子弟礼待歆者；进军相待者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-77ce48827f9d3d1f5020","zhonghua-q-b8f4e3387f54f52da934","zhonghua-q-6dc55a9ca6ee03cb5121","zhonghua-q-197a8859eb4316966bd1","zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846"]},{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"幅巾奉迎者；被说之豫章太守；葛巾迎策者；拒避出而从容待策者；为江南贤士所服、号华独坐者；决策出迎者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-77ce48827f9d3d1f5020","zhonghua-q-b8f4e3387f54f52da934","zhonghua-q-6dc55a9ca6ee03cb5121","zhonghua-q-197a8859eb4316966bd1","zhonghua-q-e22152a0db3e83134242","zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"奉使说歆者；奉使者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-b8f4e3387f54f52da934","zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846"]},{"person":"zhonghua-p0005","role":"劝议之功曹","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-77ce48827f9d3d1f5020","zhonghua-q-b8f4e3387f54f52da934","zhonghua-q-6dc55a9ca6ee03cb5121","zhonghua-q-197a8859eb4316966bd1","zhonghua-q-e22152a0db3e83134242","zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-77ce48827f9d3d1f5020","source_order":[13,152,0],"order":2881}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0340","name":"华歆","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhonghua-p0005","name":"刘壹","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0058","name":"虞翻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-197a8859eb4316966bd1","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cdd573d0e937632e5fd8","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策略有扬州，盛兵徇豫章，一郡大恐。官属请出郊迎，教曰：‘无然。’策稍进，复白发兵，又不听。及策至，一府皆造阁，请出避之。乃笑曰：‘今将自来，何遽避之？’有顷，门下白曰：‘孙将军至！’请见，乃前，与歆共坐，谈议良久，夜乃别去。义士闻之，皆长叹息而心自服也。策遂亲执子弟之礼，礼为上宾。","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fb170c40de8e1a06b8b","start":114,"end":256,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-2b82ce59e7697566b846","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cdd573d0e937632e5fd8","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策在椒丘，遣虞翻说歆。翻既去，歆请功曹刘壹入议。壹劝歆住城，遣檄迎军。歆曰：‘吾虽刘刺史所置；上用，犹是剖符吏也。今从卿计，恐死有余责矣。’壹曰：‘王景兴既汉朝所用，且尔时会稽人众盛强，犹见原恕；明府何虑？’于是夜逆作檄，明旦出城，遣吏赍迎。策便进军，与歆相见。待以上宾，接以朋友之礼。","attribution":"裴注·虞溥江表传","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fb170c40de8e1a06b8b","start":355,"end":499,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-6dc55a9ca6ee03cb5121","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cdd573d0e937632e5fd8","layer":"pei","quote":"歆葛巾迎策，策谓歆曰：‘府君年德名望，远近所归；策年幼稚，宜修子弟之礼。’便向歆拜","attribution":"裴注·胡冲吴历","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fb170c40de8e1a06b8b","start":62,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-77ce48827f9d3d1f5020","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-c6ec1c17d1926b356003","layer":"original","quote":"孙策略地江东，歆知策善用兵，乃幅巾奉迎〖9〗。策以其长者，待以上宾之礼。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-b8f4e3387f54f52da934","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cdd573d0e937632e5fd8","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策击豫章，先遣虞翻说歆。歆答曰：‘歆久在江表，常欲北归；孙会稽来，吾便去也。’翻还报策，策乃进军。","attribution":"裴注·胡冲吴历","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fb170c40de8e1a06b8b","start":12,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-e22152a0db3e83134242","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cdd573d0e937632e5fd8","layer":"pei","quote":"是时四方贤士大夫避地江南者，甚众，皆出其下，人人望风。每策大会，坐上莫敢先发言；歆时起更衣，则论议喧哗。歆能剧饮，至石余不乱。众人微察，常以其整衣冠为异。江南号之曰‘华独坐","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fb170c40de8e1a06b8b","start":256,"end":342,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
